<body>
  <a class="skip-link" href="#recipe">Skip to recipe</a>
  <div class="page">
    <header class="site-header">
      <a class="brand" href="#" aria-label="The Sunday Table home">
        <svg viewBox="0 0 40 44" fill="none" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M13 16C9 9 14 4 20 3c1 6-1 11-7 13Z" fill="currentColor"/><path d="M17 15c4-7 13-6 17-2-4 5-11 7-17 2Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M7 21c6-7 18-7 24 0 5 6 1 14-6 17-3 1-3 3-5 3s-2-2-5-3C7 35 2 28 7 21Z" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5"/><path d="M10 25c-1 4 1 6 4 8" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>
        <span>the sunday table</span>
      </a>
      <div class="header-note">The recipe journal <span aria-hidden="true"></span> Breakfast &amp; brunch</div>
    </header>
    <main>
      <article>
        <section class="hero" aria-labelledby="recipe-title">
          <div class="hero-copy">
            <p class="category">Breakfast &amp; brunch</p>
            <h1 id="recipe-title">Lemon ricotta pancakes</h1>
            <p class="intro">Soft, golden pancakes with creamy ricotta and a bright little lift of lemon.</p>
            <div class="recipe-meta" aria-label="Recipe details">
              <div class="meta-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="12" cy="12" r="9"/><path d="M12 6v6l4 2" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg><span><strong>25</strong> minutes</span></div>
              <div class="meta-item"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><circle cx="9" cy="7" r="3"/><path d="M3 21v-3a6 6 0 0 1 12 0v3M16 4a3 3 0 0 1 0 6m2 4a5 5 0 0 1 3 4v3" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg><span>Serves <strong>4</strong></span></div>
            </div>
            <div class="hero-actions">
              <a class="button button-primary" href="#recipe">Jump to recipe <svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M12 4v16m-6-6 6 6 6-6" stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round"/></svg></a>
              <button class="button button-print" type="button" onclick="window.print()"><svg viewBox="0 0 24 24" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="1.5" aria-hidden="true"><path d="M7 8V3h10v5M7 17H4V9h16v8h-3M7 14h10v7H7z" stroke-linejoin="round"/><path d="M17 11h.01" stroke-linecap="round"/></svg>Print recipe</button>
            </div>
          </div>
          <figure class="hero-figure">
            <img class="hero-image" src="PANCAKE_IMAGE" width="1024" height="1280" alt="A stack of golden lemon ricotta pancakes topped with ricotta and lemon zest on an ivory plate, with fresh lemons alongside." fetchpriority="high">
          </figure>
        </section>
        <section class="recipe" id="recipe" aria-labelledby="recipe-heading">
          <div class="recipe-heading">
            <h2 id="recipe-heading">A little whisk. A little sunshine.</h2>
            <p>Gather your ingredients. Let’s make pancakes.</p>
          </div>
          <div class="recipe-grid">
            <section class="ingredients" aria-labelledby="ingredients-heading">
              <div class="ingredients-header"><h3 id="ingredients-heading">Ingredients</h3><span>Serves 4</span></div>
              <ul class="ingredient-list">
                <li><label class="ingredient"><input type="checkbox"><span><strong>1 cup</strong> ricotta</span></label></li>
                <li><label class="ingredient"><input type="checkbox"><span><strong>¾ cup</strong> milk</span></label></li>
                <li><label class="ingredient"><input type="checkbox"><span><strong>2</strong> eggs</span></label></li>
                <li><label class="ingredient"><input type="checkbox"><span>Zest of <strong>1 lemon</strong></span></label></li>
                <li><label class="ingredient"><input type="checkbox"><span><strong>1 cup</strong> flour</span></label></li>
                <li><label class="ingredient"><input type="checkbox"><span><strong>2 tablespoons</strong> sugar</span></label></li>
                <li><label class="ingredient"><input type="checkbox"><span><strong>1 teaspoon</strong> baking powder</span></label></li>
                <li><label class="ingredient"><input type="checkbox"><span>A pinch of salt</span></label></li>
                <li><label class="ingredient"><input type="checkbox"><span>Butter, for the pan</span></label></li>
              </ul>
            </section>
            <section class="method" aria-labelledby="method-heading">
              <h3 id="method-heading">Method</h3>
              <ol class="steps">
                <li><div><span class="step-title">Whisk the wet ingredients</span><p>In a bowl, whisk together the ricotta, milk, eggs, and lemon zest.</p></div></li>
                <li><div><span class="step-title">Fold in the dry ingredients</span><p>Add the flour, sugar, baking powder, and salt. Gently fold into the ricotta mixture until just combined.</p></div></li>
                <li><div><span class="step-title">Give it a moment</span><p>Let the batter rest for 5 minutes.</p></div></li>
                <li><div><span class="step-title">Cook until golden</span><p>Butter a pan over medium heat. Add the batter in portions and cook until bubbles form on the surface. Flip once and cook the other side until golden.</p></div></li>
              </ol>
            </section>
          </div>
        </section>
      </article>
    </main>
    <footer><span class="footer-brand">the sunday table</span><span>Lemon ricotta pancakes</span></footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
EOF'

